{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S03、S06等段的感受提示仍然偏密，而且S09把“想在难受时有人陪”推成“甚至愿意再受那些气”，比Y更容易替人物过早确定动机。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"平\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用放大加亮的关键词让每段的核心转折更容易被抓住，感受文字缩小并随音乐节点出现，观众可以先理解人物在经历什么，再留意音乐如何表现这种变化。Y的完整叙述在心理动机上略显稳妥，尤其对孤独和陪伴的解释更具体、克制；但X的视觉层次、重点辨识和音乐感受的细腻程度整体更好，更适合边听边扫屏幕。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "36ae925b-6622-421f-ba51-a341214f3cd4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T010000959089Z", "elapsed_seconds": 69.532, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:01:10.500327+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f74ee53e85f2cfd3fb286fc01efaf781ae879d2e2aef58b26c85ccfda7f44338", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "